drop x86: only restore TSC if we have IA32_TSC_ADJUST or directsync enabled
drop x86: don't check for random warps if using direct sync
drop x86: revert extra time added to check for tsc wraps

# Fixed DSC rate from EDID.
drop drm/edid: rename VESA block parsing functions to more generic name
drop drm/edid: prepare for VESA vendor-specific data block extension
drop drm/edid: MSO should only be used for non-eDP displays
drop drm/edid: parse DSC DPP passthru support flag for mode VII timings
drop drm/edid: for consistency, use mask everywhere for block rev parsing
drop drm/edid: parse DRM VESA dsc bpp target
drop drm/amd: use fixed dsc bits-per-pixel from edid

# zram rework: CachyOS dropped it in 7.4.
drop zram: prefix backends printk-s
drop zram: remove debugfs entry on init failure
drop zram: zstd: do not allocate empty C/D-dictionaries
drop zram: lz4hc: pre-initialize dictionary stream in setup_params
drop zram: lz4: use LZ4_decompress_safe_usingDict()
drop zram: lz4hc: use LZ4_decompress_safe_usingDict()
drop zram: zstd: do not use kvzalloc() for zstd allocations
drop zram: reset writeback state in zram_reset_device()
drop zram: split zcomp into separate R/W streams
drop zram: use a singleton compression context for recompression
drop zram: use rw_semaphore for decompression streams

# Passive VRR: CachyOS dropped it in 7.4.
